# Local SQLite stores: one per signed-in account (`notes-<hash>.db`), plus SQLite's
# sidecar files (-wal/-shm/-journal). User data, not source — the schema is created and
# migrated automatically, so versioning one buys nothing and commits your notes.
notes.db
notes-*.db*

